       VI. Correctness and Provenance Tests

   The eval-bar tests cover WDL conservation, symmetry,
monotonicity, bounded smoothing, bitboard snapshot iden-
tity, incremental-state reuse, homemade source labeling,
bounded residuals, and homemade WDL monotonicity. The

